Auto (legacy, per transmit)␀Only pick External with an antenna fitted to the external socket. After a reboot it starts on the on-board antenna, unless the switch below is on.␀␀LoRa antenna (P4)␀␀␀Starts on the external socket at every boot. Only for an antenna that stays connected.␀␀Always use the external antenna (MMCX)␀␀Reads packets on a background task so a busy screen can't drop them.␀␀␀␀Buffered receive (experimental)␀Resends a message until a repeater echoes it or the recipient ACKs. Turn off to send once only.␀Retry sends until heard␀Signal probe␀␀␀␀Sends a zero-hop advert when no neighbour has been heard for a while, so the signal reading stays fresh. Neighbours only; nothing is repeated.␀␀Auto-discover␀␀␀Minutes, 1 to 1440.␀Poll every␀␀Auto advert␀Open Advertise app␀␀Send an advert now, or set how often you re-advertise.␀␀Backlight␀␀␀Medium␀␀F11 on the keyboard steps through these too.␀␀␀␀Keyboard backlight␀␀Keyboard layouts␀␀␀␀Tap the language key (EN) on the on-screen keyboard to cycle through the layouts you turn on.␀␀␀Typing␀␀Pick accented letters as you type. Off is plain typing.␀Accent popups␀␀␀Up to three words over the message that finish or fix the one you're typing, or come next; tap one to use it. Your own words and phrases come first.␀␀␀␀Predictive text␀With Predictive text on, Space fixes or finishes a word that isn't one, as on a phone. Backspace straight after puts back what you typed.␀␀␀Space completes the word␀␀␀␀Dictionary: %d words.␀␀␀Dictionary: downloads over Wi-Fi the first time, or copy dictionaries/words-en.pwd to the SD card's predict folder. Until then, your own words are suggested.␀␀␀Highly experimental. This forwards the text, sender name and timestamp of every message your node receives to an MQTT broker, where anyone able to read the broker can read them. Direct messages are private messages from other people who never agreed to be shared. Use a broker you control, set an encryption key below, and never a public broker.␀␀␀I accept the privacy risk␀␀␀Enable MQTT bridge␀␀Broker␀␀Broker host / IP␀␀␀␀192.168.1.x␀Port␀␀␀␀1883␀␀␀␀Leave empty if not required␀Username (optional)␀Password (optional)␀Publish␀Publish channel messages␀␀␀␀Other people's private messages to you. Only to a broker you control.␀␀␀Publish direct messages␀Encryption␀␀Empty = plaintext to a private broker␀␀␀Encryption key (optional)␀␀␀host␀␀␀␀psk␀ïƒ‡␀Nothing above applies until you save.␀␀␀Internal DRAM
